{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hatch. Evolve. Collect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-UseGachaMachine.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hatch, feed and play with your monsters to evolve them into their ultimate forms. Each monster you evolve is a new entry in your Codex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-HatchEgg.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Evo Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-EvoItem.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all monsters evolve the same way. Some need special Evo Items to trigger their transformations. Discover all of the combinations to complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-Codex.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">While you Work!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-WhileWorking.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This idle desktop companion runs quietly in the background while you use your computer, giving you a fun and relaxing way to build your monster collection over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share your Favourite Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got a rare egg? Evolved a monster into a special form? Use the built-in screenshot tool to snap and share your favourite moments with friends and the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flexible Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise how the game behaves - Keep it tucked behind your windows, or bring it to the front. Switch the game to another monitor, change the colour scheme and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655520?t=1747328423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655520?t=1747328423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/f9cbe621d569878164cd34650f40d8b78c643fd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747328423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/f9cbe621d569878164cd34650f40d8b78c643fd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747328423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hatch. Evolve. Collect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-UseGachaMachine.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hatch, feed and play with your monsters to evolve them into their ultimate forms. Each monster you evolve is a new entry in your Codex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-HatchEgg.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Evo Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-EvoItem.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all monsters evolve the same way. Some need special Evo Items to trigger their transformations. Discover all of the combinations to complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-Codex.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">While you Work!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/TomokinMonsters-WhileWorking.gif?t=1747328423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This idle desktop companion runs quietly in the background while you use your computer, giving you a fun and relaxing way to build your monster collection over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share your Favourite Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got a rare egg? Evolved a monster into a special form? Use the built-in screenshot tool to snap and share your favourite moments with friends and the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flexible Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise how the game behaves - Keep it tucked behind your windows, or bring it to the front. Switch the game to another monitor, change the colour scheme and more.</p>","developers":["Tomokin"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/0d1fc95196e8e9b49118eabd80bed5bf33665cd0/header.jpg?t=1747328423","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129883,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129883/movie480.mp4?t=1746027067","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129883/movie_max.m